ったので強くは言えない）","ts":"1619881359.218600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"36X3V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2df534ce-a827-442d-8b1a-25f48bf3ac1d","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"Freeで複垢だめよ、ってことだから、会社側で有料垢用意しような、という気持ちにはなる","ts":"1619881336.217800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ASKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"042f1525-4288-4ca6-a23b-545db4ecfa30","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"まぁでもアレですね","ts":"1619881314.216800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ronf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee5e2260-17ea-44ae-ba43-231f79170519","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Enterprise 導入するかどうかは会社の判断だからなぁ。あとそんな事言うなら複垢するわいって気持ち","ts":"1619881269.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MB9O"}]}]
